\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nComplete the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>$6$</td><td>$4$</td><td>{{field-1}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$6$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$-4$</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>"] [:db/add "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d" :question/worked-solution "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+(-2)\\cdot0+(-3)\\cdot(-2) = 6 \\\\ c_{12} &= 0\\cdot0+(-2)\\cdot1+(-3)\\cdot(-2) = 4 \\\\ c_{13} &= 0\\cdot1+(-2)\\cdot1+(-3)\\cdot0 = -2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot0+(-3)\\cdot(-2) = 6 \\\\ c_{22} &= 0\\cdot0+0\\cdot1+(-3)\\cdot(-2) = 6 \\\\ c_{23} &= 0\\cdot1+0\\cdot1+(-3)\\cdot0 = 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+0\\cdot0+2\\cdot(-2) = -4 \\\\ c_{32} &= 0\\cdot0+0\\cdot1+2\\cdot(-2) = -4 \\\\ c_{33} &= 0\\cdot1+0\\cdot1+2\\cdot0 = 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 6 & 0 \\\\ -4 & -4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"] [:db/add "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d" :question/answer-fields "51edd1f2-b812-523b-abbe-85d60961339a"] [:db/add "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d" :question/answer-fields "a0f850f6-8748-5d8d-a5de-b71d7fc0f0ac"] [:db/add "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d" :question/answer-fields "0a27d422-1f1b-5635-9f53-96efadf2c84e"] [:db/ensure "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059747 :knowledge-point/questions "2bc63496-8a91-558d-b570-5e93e95d274d"] [:db/add "45eb5595-0d7f-5cfd-b884-4a08f4b6e469" :answer/id #uuid "45eb5595-0d7f-5cfd-b884-4a08f4b6e469"] [:db