div>\n\nComplete the product.\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>$-6$</td><td>$1$</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$-6$</td><td>$0$</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>$1$</td><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>$0$</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>"] [:db/add "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c" :question/worked-solution "Multiply each row of $A$ by each column of $B$, adding the three pairwise products.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{11} &= (-3)\\cdot(-1)+(-1)\\cdot3+0\\cdot(-3) = 0 \\\\ c_{12} &= (-3)\\cdot2+(-1)\\cdot0+0\\cdot1 = -6 \\\\ c_{13} &= (-3)\\cdot(-1)+(-1)\\cdot2+0\\cdot2 = 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{21} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+(-2)\\cdot3+0\\cdot(-3) = -6 \\\\ c_{22} &= 0\\cdot2+(-2)\\cdot0+0\\cdot1 = 0 \\\\ c_{23} &= 0\\cdot(-1)+(-2)\\cdot2+0\\cdot2 = -4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}c_{31} &= 2\\cdot(-1)+1\\cdot3+0\\cdot(-3) = 1 \\\\ c_{32} &= 2\\cdot2+1\\cdot0+0\\cdot1 = 4 \\\\ c_{33} &= 2\\cdot(-1)+1\\cdot2+0\\cdot2 = 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -6 & 1 \\\\ -6 & 0 & -4 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n"] [:db/add "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c" :question/answer-fields "71cb0d60-f367-5cd0-a9f4-3f51049f046b"] [:db/add "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c" :question/answer-fields "dec6cbb5-4f7f-51ae-b95d-4285a8703d7e"] [:db/add "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c" :question/answer-fields "47480982-15d2-557b-abdd-f628cabc1964"] [:db/ensure "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186059747 :knowledge-point/questions "8a62837b-960e-5f58-bcbf-bfe8c7077a6c"] [:db/add "bdb863d6-daa9-579f-98f4-43987ce3f589" :answer/id #uuid "bdb863d6-daa9-579f-98f4-43987ce3f589"] [:db/add "bdb863d6-daa9-579f-98f4-43987ce3f589" :answer/ty